Retail Sales Analysis Using Python and SQL

About the Project

This project analyzes retail sales data to understand sales performance, product profitability, customer spending, and regional business performance. Python and SQL are used to explore the data and identify useful business insights.

Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- SQL
- Matplotlib
- SQLite

Project Features

- Clean and prepare retail sales data.
- Calculate total sales, profit, and profit margin.
- Analyze monthly sales trends.
- Compare profit across product subcategories.
- Identify top customers and regional performance.
- Find products or subcategories generating losses.
- Explore the impact of discounts on profit.

Project Structure

```text
retail-sales-analysis/
